  "title": "Auditory naming task with questions that begin or end with a wh-interrogative",
  "description": "This dataset comprises neuroimaging recordings from an auditory naming task in which participants respond to questions beginning or ending with wh-interrogatives. The study investigates language processing and naming responses during structured auditory stimulation, with potential applications in understanding linguistic comprehension and production mechanisms.",
